        "created_at": "2012-06-03T19:24:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As Absolute Zero’s Impale card is not Limited, am I correct in ruling that multiple Impale cards can be played against a single target?</p>\n<p>Absolute Zero worked over Citizen Dawn last night with two impales for a good long while and I couldn’t see any ruling that would indicate this was incorrect.</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
